"index_reference": "isaka",
"language": "swh",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>Jina Isaka linamaanisha &quot;anacheka,&quot; ambalo linaonyesha jinsi alivyokuwa amezaliwa. Wakati Mungu aliahidi kuzaliwa kwa Isaka, wote Abrahamu na Sara walicheka kwa kutoamini (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01017015\" data-end-ref=\"01017019\">Mwanzo 17:15–19</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01018009\" data-end-ref=\"01018015\">18:9–15</data>). Mungu alikuwa ameahidi Abrahamu mwana (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01015004\" data-end-ref=\"01015006\">Mwanzo 15:4–6</data>). Hata hivyo, hakuna mwana aliyekuja, na Abrahamu na Sara walikuwa wazee sana kupata watoto. Kwa hiyo, wakati Isaka alizaliwa, walicheka kwa furaha (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01021006\" data-end-ref=\"01021007\">Mwanzo 21:6–7</data>).</p><p>Wakati Isaka alipokuwa kijana, Mungu alimjaribu Abrahamu kwa kumwambia amtoe Isaka kuwa dhabihu (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01022001\" data-end-ref=\"01022019\">Mwanzo 22:1–19</data>). Imani ya Abrahamu ilibaki thabiti. Alitii na Isaka alijisalimisha kwake. Mungu kisha aliingilia kati na kutoa kondoo dume kwa dhabihu badala ya Isaka. Kwa sababu ya imani ya Abrahamu, Mungu aliahidi baraka kubwa (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01022015\" data-end-ref=\"01022018\">Mwanzo 22:15–18</data>).</p><p>Isaka alimuoa Rebeka na alikuwa tayari kuendeleza ukoo ulioteuliwa, lakini Rebeka hakuweza kupata watoto (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01025021\" data-end-ref=\"01025021\">Mwanzo 25:21</data>). Badala ya kujaribu kutatua matatizo mwenyewe kama Baba yake alivyofanya (tazama <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01016001\" data-end-ref=\"01016016\">Mwanzo 16:1–16</data>), Isaka alimwomba Bwana, na Rebeka alizaa watoto mapacha wa kiume. Isaka alimpenda Esau, mwana mkubwa, wakati Rebeka alimpenda Yakobo. Upendeleo huu ulisababisha Yakobo kumdanganya Isaka alipokuwa mzee na kipofu (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01027001\" data-end-ref=\"01027040\">Mwanzo 27:1–40</data>). Upendeleo uliendelea kuwa tatizo miongoni mwa wazao wa Isaka (tazama <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01029030\" data-end-ref=\"01029030\">Mwanzo 29:30</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01033001\" data-end-ref=\"01033002\">33:1–2</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01037004\" data-end-ref=\"01037004\">37:4</data>).</p><p>Isaka alifuata mfano wa baba yake Abrahamu katika kushughulika na mataifa jirani. Wakati wa njaa, alitembelea ufalme mwingine na, kwa hofu, akasema kwamba mke wake ni dada yake (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01026001\" data-end-ref=\"01026011\">Mwanzo 26:1–11</data>; linganisha <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01012010\" data-end-ref=\"01012020\">12:10–20</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01020001\" data-end-ref=\"01020018\">20:1–18</data>). Kama baba yake, Isaka alifanikiwa katika nchi hiyo na aliombwa kuondoka (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01026012\" data-end-ref=\"01026016\">Mwanzo 26:12–16</data>; linganisha <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01012016\" data-end-ref=\"01012020\">12:16–20</data>). Alikabiliana na migogoro juu ya maji na ardhi na wachungaji wengine (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01026017\" data-end-ref=\"01026022\">Mwanzo 26:17–22</data>; linganisha <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01021025\" data-end-ref=\"01021031\">21:25–31</data>). Pia alifanya agano na mfalme wa Wafilisti (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01026026\" data-end-ref=\"01026031\">Mwanzo 26:26–31</data>; linganisha <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01021022\" data-end-ref=\"01021032\">21:22–32</data>).</p><p>Isaka alipokea ahadi sawa na baba yake (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01026002\" data-end-ref=\"01026005\">Mwanzo 26:2–5</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01026023\" data-end-ref=\"01026025\">23–25</data>; linganisha <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01022016\" data-end-ref=\"01022018\">22:16–18</data>). Alionyesha kujitolea kwake kwa kuendeleza desturi ya tohara, ambayo iliwakilisha agano (tazama <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44007008\" data-end-ref=\"44007008\">Matendo 7:8</data>). Kama mtoto wa ahadi, Isaka anawakilisha wote ambao ni watoto wa Abrahamu kupitia imani katika Kristo. Wao ni huru kuishi kama watoto wa Mungu, si kama watumwa (tazama <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"48004021\" data-end-ref=\"48005001\">Wagalatia 4:21–5:1</data>).</p><p><u>Sehemu za Kujifunza Zaidi</u></p><p><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01017019\" data-end-ref=\"01017021\">Mwanzo 17:19–21</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01021001\" data-end-ref=\"01021012\">21:1–12</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01022001\" data-end-ref=\"01022019\">22:1–19</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01024001\" data-end-ref=\"01024008\">24:1–8</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01024014\" data-end-ref=\"01024014\">14</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01024062\" data-end-ref=\"01024067\">62–67</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01025005\" data-end-ref=\"01025011\">25:5–11</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01025019\" data-end-ref=\"01025028\">19–28</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01026001\" data-end-ref=\"01028009\">26:1–28:9</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01031042\" data-end-ref=\"01031042\">31:42</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01035012\" data-end-ref=\"01035012\">35:12</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01035027\" data-end-ref=\"01035028\">27–28</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01048015\" data-end-ref=\"01048016\">48:15–16</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01049031\" data-end-ref=\"01049031\">49:31</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02003006\" data-end-ref=\"02003006\">Kutoka 3:6</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"06024003\" data-end-ref=\"06024004\">Yoshua 24:3–4</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"45009006\" data-end-ref=\"45009010\">Warumi 9:6–10</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"48004021\" data-end-ref=\"48004031\">Wagalatia 4:21–31</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58011008\" data-end-ref=\"58011009\">Waebrania 11:8–9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58011017\" data-end-ref=\"58011020\">17–20</data></p>",
