{
"content_id": "734297",
"reference_id": 203397,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "Ishmaeli",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "ishmaeli",
"language": "swh",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>Ishmaeli alikuwa mwana wa kwanza wa Abrahamu, alizaliwa na Hajiri, mtumishi wa Misri wa Sara. Mvulana alizaliwa karibu na Hebroni wakati Abrahamu alikuwa na umri wa miaka themanini na sita (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01013018\" data-end-ref=\"01013018\">Mwanzo 13:18</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01016016\" data-end-ref=\"01016016\">16:16</data>). Mungu aliahidi kumfanya Abrahamu asiye na watoto kuwa taifa kubwa (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01012002\" data-end-ref=\"01012002\">Mwanzo 12:2</data>). Mungu alimhakikishia kwamba angekuwa na mwana kama mrithi wake (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01015004\" data-end-ref=\"01015004\">15:4</data>). Ishmaeli alizaliwa wakati Abrahamu alijaribu kutimiza ahadi ya Mungu kwa njia za kibinadamu (tazama <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01016001\" data-end-ref=\"01016016\">Mwanzo 16:1–16</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"48004023\" data-end-ref=\"48004023\">Wagalatia 4:23</data>). Hata hivyo, Mungu bado alitimiza malengo yake kupitia Sara (tazama <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01017015\" data-end-ref=\"01017018\">Mwanzo 17:15–18:15</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01021001\" data-end-ref=\"01021007\">21:1–7</data>).</p><p>Mungu alisema Sara angepata mwana ili kutimiza ahadi (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01017015\" data-end-ref=\"01017016\">Mwanzo 17:15–16</data>). Abrahamu alimwomba Mungu amkubali Ishmaeli (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01017017\" data-end-ref=\"01017018\">17:17–18</data>). Ishmaeli hakuwa mwana wa ahadi kwa sababu makubaliano maalum ya Mungu (agano) yalikuwa na Isaka (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01017019\" data-end-ref=\"01017019\">Mwanzo 17:19</data>). Hata hivyo, Mungu alimbariki Ishmaeli na kumfanya baba wa taifa kubwa (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01017020\" data-end-ref=\"01017021\">Mwanzo 17:20–21</data>).</p><p>Wakati Ishmaeli alipokuwa na miaka kumi na mitatu, alitahiriwa kama sehemu ya agano la Mungu na Abrahamu (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01017009\" data-end-ref=\"01017014\">Mwanzo 17:9–14</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01017023\" data-end-ref=\"01017027\">23–27</data>). Katika sherehe ya kumwachisha Isaka kunyonya, wakati Ishmaeli alipokuwa na umri wa miaka kumi na saba, alimdhihaki Isaka (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01021009\" data-end-ref=\"01021009\">Mwanzo 21:9</data>). Kwa sababu hiyo, Abrahamu alimpeleka Ishmaeli na Hajiri mbali na akawapa mahitaji. Malaika wa Mungu alimsaidia Hajiri kuishi katika nyika, na Ishmaeli akawa mwindaji. Alikaa katika nyika ya Parani na akaoa mwanamke wa Misri (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01021020\" data-end-ref=\"01021021\">Mwanzo 21:20–21</data>). Ishmaeli alisaidia kumzika Abrahamu (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01025009\" data-end-ref=\"01025010\">Mwanzo 25:9–10</data>). Alimpa binti yake Mahalathi kuolewa na Esau (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01028009\" data-end-ref=\"01028009\">28:9</data>). Ishmaeli alikufa akiwa na umri wa miaka 137 (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01025017\" data-end-ref=\"01025017\">25:17</data>). Wanawe kumi na wawili wametajwa katika <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01025013\" data-end-ref=\"01025015\">Mwanzo 25:13–15</data>.</p><p>Paulo alimtaja Ishmaeli ili kuwatia moyo Wagalatia kumtumaini Mungu badala ya sheria (tazama <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"48004021\" data-end-ref=\"48004031\">Wagalatia 4:21–31</data>). Wale wanaotegemea sheria hawatarithi ufalme, kama vile mwana wa mwanamke mtumwa hakurithi pamoja na mwana wa mwanamke huru (<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"48004030\" data-end-ref=\"48004030\">Wagalatia 4:30</data>).</p><p><u>Sehemu za Kujifunza Zaidi</u></p><p><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01016011\" data-end-ref=\"01016016\">Mwanzo 16:11–16</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01017018\" data-end-ref=\"01017026\">Mwanzo 17:18–26</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01021008\" data-end-ref=\"01021021\">21:8–21</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01025009\" data-end-ref=\"01025018\">25:9–18</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01028009\" data-end-ref=\"01028009\">28:9</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"48004021\" data-end-ref=\"48004031\">Wagalatia 4:21–31</data></p>",
